{"3458900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Problem Solved", "steam_appid": 3458900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4737750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tedious situation inevitably leads to the birth of an unstoppable problem solver. Are you gonna be the one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is yes, don’t forget. In this test of wit, teamwork and quick thinking, there’s no end to challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/18b5981a76aa8e56f92457180760e273.poster.avif?t=1781858383\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/18b5981a76aa8e56f92457180760e273.webm?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/18b5981a76aa8e56f92457180760e273.mp4?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home we need, a home we build. Decorate every inch of your base with various furnitures, expressive art pieces and many electronic devices that goes “Bzzzzt!”. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devices you built will come to your aid in your adventures in countless universes. Develop equipments, upgrade them and decide which ones you’ll bring them your next quest. I’ll say that one time. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/902eb191b83d95aed08e4a87f90f3d59.poster.avif?t=1781858383\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/902eb191b83d95aed08e4a87f90f3d59.webm?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/902eb191b83d95aed08e4a87f90f3d59.mp4?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your hardwork in your trophy section. Everyone needs to be aware of your unrivalled achievements. You can even adopt a pet when you earn enough experience points. Wouldn’t it be great if you have a pet cat? Or a pet mouse? Or a pet… xenomorph?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/cb29ce6ca59af8d662e45f45d8e08934.poster.avif?t=1781858383\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/cb29ce6ca59af8d662e45f45d8e08934.webm?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/cb29ce6ca59af8d662e45f45d8e08934.mp4?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cosmic catastrophes to underwater disasters, insert every mission into their limits. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/adfd4f19a362cbf54ec5c83df4012912.poster.avif?t=1781858383\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/adfd4f19a362cbf54ec5c83df4012912.webm?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/adfd4f19a362cbf54ec5c83df4012912.mp4?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave a deadly meteor shower to retrieve valuable cargo from a space station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/7ef816c4c49210dbaf125ade2ad82146.poster.avif?t=1781858383\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/7ef816c4c49210dbaf125ade2ad82146.webm?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/7ef816c4c49210dbaf125ade2ad82146.mp4?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evacuate a rapidly sinking submarine and save the crew before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/ea2833ea850dab15f804a75435e4d223.poster.avif?t=1781858383\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/ea2833ea850dab15f804a75435e4d223.webm?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/ea2833ea850dab15f804a75435e4d223.mp4?t=1781858383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two trains on the way crashing into each other. No way to save every person? Just find one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> And More:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level brings fresh thrills and unforgettable challenges to prove your brilliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/36ab8aafaba56867e85db2420e678201.poster.avif?t=1781